## Performance Requirements

### Bundle Optimization
- Main route JS ≤ 180KB gzipped
- Charts lazy-loaded via dynamic imports
- Images optimized with next/image
- Code splitting for dashboard components

### Core Web Vitals Targets
```typescript
// Performance budgets
const PERFORMANCE_TARGETS = {
  LCP: 2000, // Largest Contentful Paint ≤ 2.0s
  CLS: 0.03, // Cumulative Layout Shift ≤ 0.03
  FID: 100,  // First Input Delay ≤ 100ms
  mainBundleSize: 180 * 1024, // 180KB gzipped
  chartRender: 50,   // First chart render ≤ 50ms
  filterUpdate: 80,  // Filter update ≤ 80ms
};
```

### Lighthouse Targets
- Performance ≥ 90
- Accessibility ≥ 95
- Best Practices ≥ 95
- SEO ≥ 90

## Security & Headers
```typescript
// next.config.js security configuration
const securityHeaders = [
  {
    key: 'Content-Security-Policy',
    value: `
      default-src 'self';
      script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline';
      style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline';
      img-src 'self' data: https:;
      font-src 'self';
    `.replace(/\s{2,}/g, ' ').trim()
  },
  {
    key: 'X-Content-Type-Options',
    value: 'nosniff'
  },
  {
    key: 'Referrer-Policy',
    value: 'strict-origin-when-cross-origin'
  }
];
```

